<title>BELGIUM: Italy seeks EU aid for weather-hit grain crop.</title>
<headline>Italy seeks EU aid for weather-hit grain crop.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy requested European Union aid for weather-damaged cereals and other crops but was asked to present more data to support its case, EU officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Italian Farm Minister Michele Pinto told a meeting of farm ministers that winter drought had blighted cereals and fruit and vegetable crops in northern Italy.</p>
<p>Spring frosts in April had also hit cereals and fruit and vegetable crops in the north.</p>
</text>
